!.gitkeep

# Built documentation. `docs/tester-onboarding-runbook.pdf` is rendered from
# the published runbook artifact and is ~1MB of embedded screenshots -- a
# binary that changes wholesale every time a sentence changes, which is the
# worst possible thing to keep in git history. Regenerate it from the artifact
# rather than committing it; DEPLOYMENT.md §6g names the source.
docs/*.pdf
